kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "ir-structure"
purpose: "定义 IR 层的纯数据边界与依赖约束,确保 spec/ir 不依赖执行与规划层,便于稳定复用、演进与测试. [scope-review-2026-07-12-c5-openpyxl-helpers]"
valid_scope[1]: src/scalim/
requirements[4]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r1,IR 纯数据层,"系统 MUST 保证 `spec/ir` 中的 IR 类型为纯数据/类型层,不依赖 `execution`/`planning`/`sinks` 等执行侧模块."
  r2,IR 结构调整不引入执行依赖,"系统 MUST 在 IR 结构调整或拆分时保持纯数据层边界,避免引入执行侧依赖."
  r3,IR 公开类型命名语义化,"系统 MUST 为 IR 层公开 alias/presentation 类型提供语义清晰的命名,并保持其纯类型层定位. 以下命名 MUST 生效: - `LoaderResultMapCallable` - `MainSourceRowIterableCallable` - `LookupKeySpec` - `CsvFieldPresentationIr` - `SpreadsheetFieldPresentationIr` - `PandasFieldPresentationIr`"
  r4,FieldIr.data_key 默认等于 field_id,"系统 MUST 保证 `FieldIr.data_key` 在 IR 中为非空字符串. 当构造 `FieldIr` 时未提供 `data_key` 或 `data_key` 为空字符串时,系统 MUST 将其默认设置为 `field_id`."
scenarios[8]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  r1,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r1,"ir-模块无执行层依赖","",仅导入 IR 相关模块,不会触发 execution/planning/sinks 的导入
  r2,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r2,"ir-调整后仍无执行依赖","",调整 IR 相关模块结构,仍不会触发执行侧模块导入
  r3,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r3,语义化类型命名可导入,"",调用方导入上述 IR 公开类型,导入 MUST 成功且类型语义与原能力一致
  r4,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r4,"data-key-缺省时默认-field-id","","构造 `FieldIr(field_id=\"order_id\", data_key=\"\")` 或缺省 `data_key`","`FieldIr.data_key` MUST 等于 `\"order_id\"`"